{
  "id": "23070_ikyo",
  "headword": "{依拠|いきょ}",
  "reading": "いきょ",
  "romaji": "ikyo",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "reliance; dependence; basing on",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "reliance; dependence; basing (an argument or action) on something",
      "explanation": "The act of relying on or basing something upon a particular foundation, source, or authority. A formal, academic word often used in scholarly, legal, and analytical writing."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "23070_ikyo_ex1",
      "japanese": "{事実|じじつ}に{依拠|いきょ}する。",
      "english": "To base on facts.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "23070_ikyo_ex2",
      "japanese": "この{論文|ろんぶん}は{最新|さいしん}のデータに{依拠|いきょ}している。",
      "english": "This paper is based on the latest data.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "23070_ikyo_ex3",
      "japanese": "{判決|はんけつ}は{憲法|けんぽう}の{規定|きてい}に{依拠|いきょ}して{下|くだ}された。",
      "english": "The ruling was handed down based on constitutional provisions.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A formal compound of {依|い} (rely on) + {拠|きょ} (basis/grounds). Almost exclusively used in written, academic, and legal contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- 〜に{依拠|いきょ}する: to be based on, to rely on\n- 〜に{依拠|いきょ}して: based on, relying on\n- {法律|ほうりつ}に{依拠|いきょ}する: to be based on law\n- {先行研究|せんこうけんきゅう}に{依拠|いきょ}する: to rely on previous research\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {基|もと}づく: to be based on — the standard everyday expression\n- {準拠|じゅんきょ}: conformity, compliance — basing on standards or rules\n- {根拠|こんきょ}: basis, grounds — the foundation itself (not the act of relying)\n- {依存|いぞん}: dependence — relying on something, often with negative connotation",
  "schema_version": "2.0",
